,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 43 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, February to March came in at 39% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 the same pair came in at 8%. Grid 22320 had its driest year in 2022 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
